# All-int Match Pattern templates compile to a hand-rolled string scanner,
# and the record predicate inlines into the counting loop.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Cursed Technique: Match Pattern
    Using: "{a:int}-{b:int},{c:int}-{d:int}"
Maximum Technique: Count Matching
    Using: (r) -> (r.a <= r.c and r.b >= r.d) or (r.c <= r.a and r.d >= r.b)
Reveal: stdout
